  <item>
    <title>Vol.26 冬季到哈哈哈哈尔滨来看雪 ！超超超超长旅行攻略！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/65687a8d9f440f5443dd27a9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">65687a8d9f440f5443dd27a9</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 30 Nov 2023 12:05:32 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大主播再再再次闲聊超标，独自怒讲四小时推介哈尔滨！欢迎天南海北的亲戚好友冬季到大主播的家乡看冰看雪消费购物！（大主播废话太多了，为了赔礼道歉特意设置了超超超详细时间线，各位听众朋友们嫌墨迹大可以跳过，但是不能不去哈尔滨玩啊！）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 选题原因 大主播竟是最适合本期主题的大专家</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="261">04:21</a> 大主播热情宣讲本期节目主要内容分布</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="416">06:56</a> 哈尔滨简介，竟是特大型城市？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="758">12:38</a> 哈尔滨历史，抗金就是在抗哈！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="866">14:26</a> 哈尔滨冰雪节可是世界四大冰雪节之一 ！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="962">16:02</a> &nbsp;突然扯回哈尔滨的历史及其近代史，不愧是祖上富过！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1398">23:18</a> 哈尔滨所辖市区小tips</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1632">27:12</a> 东北方言知多少？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1815">30:15</a> 特色美食有什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2031">33:51</a> 气候知识大放送！</span></p><span></span><p><span>——做笔记分割线——</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2161">36:01</a> 冬季最佳旅行时间！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2399">39:59</a> 出行前的穿衣准备！！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3781">63:01</a> 到达交通&amp;市内交通</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5439">90:39</a> 一期一会的冬季符号：冰雪大世界！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="6985">116:25</a> 建筑艺术群：中央大街！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="9465">157:45</a> 想偷偷跑进去结婚 ：圣索菲亚大教堂！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10025">167:05</a> 我滴家在东北：松花江上！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="10687">178:07</a> 道里道外的道：中东铁路桥！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11103">185:03</a> 地铁新至：中华巴洛克！</span></p><span></span><p><span>个性化推荐：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="11826">197:06</a> 滑雪爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12122">202:02</a> 历史迷</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12462">207:42</a> 文艺批</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12746">212:26</a> 生活气</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="12912">215:12</a> 动物爱好者</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13165">219:25</a> CityWalk</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13414">223:34</a> 搓澡得整一个吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13677">227:57</a> &nbsp;吃吃吃查缺补漏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13743">229:03</a> 住住住在哪里</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="13950">232:30</a> 纪念品的选购技巧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="14092">234:52</a> 附赠一些拓展旅行的周边线路！</span></p>]]></description>
